type: software
title: Aureon OS
version: 2.1.0
abstract: >-
  Aureon OS is a local-first operating layer for evidence-heavy work, powered
  by the Harmonic Nexus Core (HNC). HNC is the research framework in this
  repository: pre-registered hypotheses with reproduction paths. The package
  version 2.1.0 is the version string in pyproject.toml on this tree. It is
  not a go-live clearance. The supported release boundary is HOLD. Rights
  holder: R&A Consulting and Brokerage Services Ltd (Companies House
  NI696693), trading as Aureon Zorza Technologies, Belfast, Northern Ireland.
